'''''Allium scorzonerifolium''''' is a yellow-flowered species of [[wild onion]] native to [[Spain]], [[Portugal]], and [[Morocco]].<ref name=margarita/><ref>Redouté, Pierre Joseph. 1803. Les Liliacées  2: plate 92</ref><ref>Fernandes, Rosette Mercedes Saraiva Batarda. 1955.  Boletim da Sociedade Broteriana II, 27: 192</ref><ref>Dobignard, D. & Chatelain, C. (2010). Index synonymique de la flore d'Afrique du nord 1: 1-455. Éditions des conservatoire et jardin botaniques, Genève.</ref><ref>[https://www.flora-on.pt/index.php?q=Allium+scorzonerifolium Flora-on, Sociedade Portuguesa de Botânica, ''Allium scorzonerifolium''] in Portuguese, color photos, range map of species distribution with Portugal, etc.</ref><ref>[https://www.floravascular.com/index.php?spp=Allium%20scorzonerifolium Flora Vascular, Allium scorzonerifolium] description in Spanish, color photos; range map of species distribution with Spain, etc</ref>

